{"version":1,"key":"card:394","content":{"id":394,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以通过 "},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ls -R","code":true}],"refId":101,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":97},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来查看一个目录的结构，它可以显示该目录包含的所有文件以及子目录，以及子目录下包含的文件和目录，但是通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ls -R","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 显示的信息有点难以阅读，在讲解其它命令之前，这里介绍一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"tree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的工具，它可以以树状的形式显示目录结构。下面给出两种方案显示目录结构，可以看到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"tree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令的输出可读性更强。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"tabs","activeKey":"ac6c4539-2ddf-4668-a97e-341a7bd6083d","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"ac6c4539-2ddf-4668-a97e-341a7bd6083d","title":"ls -R","children":[{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » ls -R\n.:\ndst  src\n\n./dst:\nhello  hello.c\n\n./src:\nhello.c  hello.md  hello2.md","language":"bash","uuid":"a1be3f5f-393a-43a9-a2cd-c416bd79d68f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"5b1f9f47-ce11-40df-bbb7-d8d1f36effce","title":"tree","children":[{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n│   ├── hello\n│   └── hello.c\n└── src\n    ├── hello.c\n    ├── hello.md\n    └── hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","language":"bash","uuid":"f1073e11-02a0-4100-b20d-1aee1c975c09","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并不是系统内置的命令，在使用之前需要进行安装，安装命令如下"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"tabs","activeKey":"8f8f581a-59d7-449f-b7cf-a858674a8e8d","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"8f8f581a-59d7-449f-b7cf-a858674a8e8d","title":"ls -R","children":[{"type":"code-block","code":"sudo apt install tree","language":"bash","uuid":"ae1d7b8a-1d3b-424b-8436-c0139ceccc4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"e8c6e1fb-19c6-4e89-a9c1-9f1ef5643945","title":"tree","children":[{"type":"code-block","code":"yum install tree","language":"bash","uuid":"c029bc9c-2bf0-4e79-91f4-40029392f626","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在输入密码之后就会进行下载，然后就可以愉快的使用了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以接收一个路径参数，来查看该路径的目录结构，默认会列出该目录下所有的内容"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 列出 /tmp 的目录结构\n~ » tree /tmp\n/tmp\n├── math\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── add\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── add.c\n├── tmpscfytyzt\n└── tmux-1000\n    └── default\n\n2 directories, 4 files","language":"bash","uuid":"2de0664c-f1b1-4ede-b229-70251c967379","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当没有为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"tree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令指定参数时，默认会列出当前所在路径的目录结构"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 当前所在路径为家目录，所以 tree 会列出家目录的目录结构\n~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── hello.c\n└── src\n    ├── hello.c\n    ├── hello.md\n    └── hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","language":"bash","uuid":"49d2d3d1-8be6-46c1-ad52-163e49b00bda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候我们根本不需要查看该目录下的所有层级内容，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-L","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项指定查看的层级深度"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# -L 1 查看一个层级的内容\n~ » tree -L 1 ~\n/home/xt\n├── dst\n└── src\n\n2 directories, 0 files","language":"bash","uuid":"b897bdbd-77af-4f00-a84e-71deb140fe86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过添加 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-s","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项可以显示文件的大小"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » tree -s ~\n/home/xt\n├── [       4096]  dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── [      16696]  hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── [         75]  hello.c\n└── [       4096]  src\n    ├── [         75]  hello.c\n    ├── [          0]  hello.md\n    └── [          0]  hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","language":"bash","uuid":"795590ab-7ccf-4400-a95a-a3a64d81c95c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述显示的文件大小信息的单位为字节，我们可以添加 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-h","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，以人类更加可读的形式显示文件大小"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » tree -sh ~\n/home/xt\n├── [4.0K]  dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── [ 16K]  hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── [  75]  hello.c\n└── [4.0K]  src\n    ├── [  75]  hello.c\n    ├── [   0]  hello.md\n    └── [   0]  hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","language":"bash","uuid":"a676d20e-4016-4188-a14e-86b99d703304","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述文件大小的单位不在仅仅是字节，对于较大的文件会自动选择相应的单位显示。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 默认会将目录信息打印在显示器上，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-o","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项指定将目录信息输出到某个文件中"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 将家目录信息输出到 home.txt 中\n~ » tree -o home.txt ~\n# cat 命令用来查看文件内容，详情见查看文件章节\n~ » cat home.txt\n/home/xt\n├── dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── hello.c\n├── home.txt\n└── src\n    ├── hello.c\n    ├── hello.md\n    └── hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 6 files","language":"bash","uuid":"ffcffe4b-663f-49f5-bede-36ce5185e519","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"tree","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令的输出指定到了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"home.txt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，然后通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令查看了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"home.txt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的内容。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["Linux/命令/tree"],"createTime":1704807339736,"updateTime":1752406167078,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752406167078},"links":{"card:101":{"key":"card:101","type":"card","id":101}}}